餘獨侯，此項羽不平。」及齊王田榮畔楚，陳餘乃使夏説説田榮曰：「項羽爲天下宰不平，盡王諸將善地，徙故王王惡地，今趙王乃居代！願王假臣兵，請以南皮爲捍蔽。」田榮欲樹黨於趙以反楚，乃遣兵從陳餘。陳餘因悉三縣兵襲常山王張耳。張耳敗走，念諸侯無可歸者，曰：「漢王與我有舊故，而項羽又彊，立我，我欲之楚。」甘公曰：「漢王之入關，五星聚東井。東井者，秦分也。先至必霸。楚雖彊，後必屬漢。」故耳走漢。漢王亦還定三秦，方圍章邯廢丘。張耳謁漢王，漢王厚遇之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"0i1_nlq_3m4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0039","start":39,"end":43,"surface":"齊王田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"nzi_ufz_vr7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"夏説","kind":"person","person_id":"fje_cj8_po0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"nzi_ufz_vr7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"0i1_nlq_3m4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"nzi_ufz_vr7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0118"