urface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p022","text":"漢二年，東撃楚，使使告趙，欲與倶。陳餘曰：「漢殺張耳乃從。」於是漢王求人類張耳者斬之，持其頭遺陳餘。陳餘乃遣兵助漢。漢之敗於彭城西，陳餘亦復覺張耳不死，即背漢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m022-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p023","text":"漢三年，韓信已定魏地，遣張耳與韓信撃破趙井陘，斬陳餘泜水上，追殺趙王歇襄國。漢立張耳爲趙王。漢五年，張耳薨，謚爲景王。子敖嗣立爲趙王。髙祖長女魯元公主爲趙王敖后。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"5kt_ucd_fbz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"5kt_ucd_fbz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n7i_lqk_3xi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"趙王歇","kind":"person","person_id":"gew_3f0_q9o","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"子敖","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0071","start":71,"end":75,"surface":"魯元公主","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m023-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"趙王敖","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p024","text":"漢七年，髙祖從平城過趙，趙王朝夕袒韛蔽，自上食，禮甚卑，有子婿禮。髙祖箕踞詈，甚慢易之。趙相貫髙、趙午等年六十餘，故張耳客也。生平爲氣，乃怒曰：「吾王孱王也！」説王曰：「夫天下豪桀并起，能者先立。今王事髙祖甚恭，而髙祖無禮，請爲王殺之！」張敖齧其指出血，曰：「君何言之誤！且先人亡國，賴髙祖得復國，德流子孫，秋豪皆髙祖力也。願君無復出口。」貫髙、趙午等十餘人皆相謂曰：「乃吾等非也。吾王長者，不倍德。且吾等義不辱，今怨髙祖辱我王，故欲殺之，何乃汙王爲乎？令事成歸王，事敗獨身坐耳。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"貫髙","kind":"person","person_id":"axo_it5_tk0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"趙午","kind":"person","person_id":"r42_dd9_xyv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"張敖","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"貫髙","kind":"person","person_id":"axo_it5_tk0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"趙午","kind":"person","person_id":"r42_dd9_xyv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0176","start":176,"end":179,"surface":"十餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文，不補成員姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m024-0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"髙祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p025","text":"漢八年，上從東垣還，過趙，貫髙等乃壁人柏人，要之置廁。上過欲宿，心動，問曰：「縣名爲何？」曰：「柏人。」「柏人者，迫於人也！」不宿而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m025-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m025-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"貫髙","kind":"person","person_id":"axo_it5_tk0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m025-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p026","text":"漢九年，貫髙怨家知其謀，乃上變告之。於是上皆并逮捕趙王、貫髙等。十餘人皆爭自剄，貫髙獨怒罵曰：「誰令公爲之？今王實無謀，而并捕王；公等皆死，誰白王不反者！」乃轞車膠致，與王詣長安。治張敖之罪。上乃詔趙群臣賓客有敢從王皆族。貫髙與客孟舒等十餘人，皆自髡鉗，爲王家奴，從來。貫髙至，對獄，曰：「獨吾屬爲之，王實不知。」吏治榜笞數千，刺剟，身無可撃者，終不復言。呂后數言張王以魯元公主故，不宜有此。上怒曰：「使張敖據天下，豈少而女乎！」不聽。廷尉以貫髙事辭聞，上曰：「壯士！誰知者，以私問之。」中大夫泄公曰：「臣之邑子，素知之。此固趙國立名義不侵爲然諾者也。」上使泄公持節問之箯輿前。仰視曰：「泄公邪？」泄公勞苦如生平驩，與語，問張王果有計謀不。髙曰：「人情寧不各愛其父母妻子乎？今吾三族皆以論死，豈以王易吾親哉！顧爲王實不反，獨吾等爲之。」具道本指所以爲者王不知狀。於是泄公入，具以報，上乃赦趙王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m026-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"貫髙","kind":"person","person_id":"axo_it5_tk0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m026-0006","start":6,"end":