","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"貫髙","kind":"person","person_id":"axo_it5_tk0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"泄公","kind":"person","person_id":"rrg_m77_llr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"泄公","kind":"person","person_id":"rrg_m77_llr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"貫髙","kind":"person","person_id":"axo_it5_tk0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"張王","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0120","start":120,"end":121,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m027-0124","start":124,"end":125,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p028","text":"張敖已出，以尚魯元公主故，封爲宣平侯。於是上賢張王諸客，以鉗奴從張王入關，無不爲諸侯相、郡守者。及孝惠、髙后、文帝、孝景時，張王客子孫皆得爲二千石。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張敖","kind":"person","person_id":"net_rj0_wi8_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0007","start":7,"end":11,"surface":"魯元公主","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m028-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"kct_zti_uvd","status":"contextua